  "question": "当 x→0 时，比较 ln(1+x) 与 x-x^2/2 的阶：求 lim_{x→0} [ln(1+x)-x+x^2/2]/x^3。",
  "answer": "极限为 1/3。",
  "techniques": [
    "麦克劳林展开",
    "阶比较",
    "分式极限"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "ln(1+x)=x-x^2/2+x^3/3+o(x^3)"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "代入得分子 ln(1+x)-x+x^2/2 = x^3/3+o(x^3)"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "除以 x^3 令 x→0，极限为 1/3。"
      }
    ],
